{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Liben": 77,
    "Player": 33
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "4122001",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "412200101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "412200101": {
            "id": "412200101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Friend! That we should meet means that fate has surely smiled upon you. Oh, how I—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200102"
            ]
          },
          "412200102": {
            "id": "412200102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Didn't you go bust?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200103"
            ]
          },
          "412200103": {
            "id": "412200103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Ah, friend, how your words wound my very soul! That lesson I was taught was sore enough. Shall we not let bygones be bygones?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200104"
            ]
          },
          "412200104": {
            "id": "412200104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "I've been working hard at the wharf since I ran myself out of house and home, and happened upon a business opportunity while I was at it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200105"
            ]
          },
          "412200105": {
            "id": "412200105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Why yes, I'm familiar with your business sense...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200106"
            ]
          },
          "412200106": {
            "id": "412200106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Oh, come now. Don't say that. I've earned a little money since, and am now completely free of debt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200107"
            ]
          },
          "412200107": {
            "id": "412200107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Either way, this business is a sure bet, the long travel distance to Sumeru notwithstanding.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200108"
            ]
          },
          "412200108": {
            "id": "412200108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "As most know, Sumeru is all rainforest and desert. Other than mushrooms, all goods are welcome there. I'm sure you understand my meaning, don't you, friend?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200109"
            ]
          },
          "412200109": {
            "id": "412200109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "The rules are the same as before. I'll collect some common goods from other lands, and send them on to Sumeru. And since we're old partners, I'll give you a special price, too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200110"
            ]
          },
          "412200110": {
            "id": "412200110",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Guess we'll give it another go...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200111"
            ]
          },
          "412200111": {
            "id": "412200111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Haha! So, this is how we'll do it—"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4122001",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "412200159"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "412200159": {
            "id": "412200159",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Hello there, friend. It's been a while, hasn't it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200160"
            ]
          },
          "412200160": {
            "id": "412200160",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hello, Liben. How have you been?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200161"
            ]
          },
          "412200161": {
            "id": "412200161",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Well, I'd say that I've found the proverbial light at the end of the tunnel at last. After returning from Sumeru previously, I did a quick cargo run to Inazuma.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200162"
            ]
          },
          "412200162": {
            "id": "412200162",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Since things weren't looking so hot in Sumeru, I decided to try my luck in Fontaine instead.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200163"
            ]
          },
          "412200163": {
            "id": "412200163",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "I was just going to observe the market a little, you know, and if I made my capital back? Well, you wouldn't see me complaining.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200164"
            ]
          },
          "412200164": {
            "id": "412200164",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "I never could have been prepared for how much the locals there loved Inazuman goods.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200165"
            ]
          },
          "412200165": {
            "id": "412200165",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "The goods I had on me and couldn't sell in other countries, such as the Ms. Hina merchandise, actually sold out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200168"
            ]
          },
          "412200168": {
            "id": "412200168",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "The people of Fontaine love messing about with mechanical devices, and relatively few, by contrast, spend time developing such trinkets as these.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200169"
            ]
          },
          "412200169": {
            "id": "412200169",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "I suppose that's the scarcity principle for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200170"
            ]
          },
          "412200170": {
            "id": "412200170",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Hahaha. Well, if it didn't look like dark clouds were gathering there too, I'd have made a few more trips for sure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200171"
            ]
          },
          "412200171": {
            "id": "412200171",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's going on over there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200172"
            ]
          },
          "412200172": {
            "id": "412200172",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Well, things just feel oppressive and dangerous... You know, like a storm is about to break out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200173"
            ]
          },
          "412200173": {
            "id": "412200173",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "The locals were pretty antsy... Said judgment was soon to come, or something like that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200174"
            ]
          },
          "412200174": {
            "id": "412200174",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "I'd suggest you refrain from going there lest you get yourself into trouble that you can't easily get out of."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4122005",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "412200520"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "412200520": {
            "id": "412200520",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Can you run me through your background again?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200521"
            ]
          },
          "412200521": {
            "id": "412200521",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "I'm Liben, and once upon a time I sold curios.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200522"
            ]
          },
          "412200522": {
            "id": "412200522",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "I've been doing good business recently.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200523"
            ]
          },
          "412200523": {
            "id": "412200523",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What kind of business are you talking about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200524"
            ]
          },
          "412200524": {
            "id": "412200524",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Ah, it's simple. You see, you just need to find me a few basic everyday items, cooking ingredients and the like, and then you trade them with me for a Box o' Marvels that are stuffed full of all kinds of nice little treasures.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200525"
            ]
          },
          "412200525": {
            "id": "412200525",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Keep in mind that I've filled these Boxes o' Marvels with the fortune I made in my time as a seller of curios. There's no booby prizes to be found here, and I treat all my customers the same.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200526"
            ]
          },
          "412200526": {
            "id": "412200526",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Why box them up and turn it into a lucky draw, you ask?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200527"
            ]
          },
          "412200527": {
            "id": "412200527",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "What can I say, people like a gift box. It just makes everyone a little more inclined to get involved.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200517"
            ]
          },
          "412200517": {
            "id": "412200517",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How are you going to earn any Mora like this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200518"
            ]
          },
          "412200518": {
            "id": "412200518",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Something like this... Let's worry about it when the time comes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200519"
            ]
          },
          "412200519": {
            "id": "412200519",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "If worse comes to worst, I'll take a trip to Natlan next time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200528"
            ]
          },
          "412200528": {
            "id": "412200528",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Can you tell me about your background again?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200529"
            ]
          },
          "412200529": {
            "id": "412200529",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "I'm Liben, and once upon a time, I sold curios.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200530"
            ]
          },
          "412200530": {
            "id": "412200530",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "I've been doing good business recently.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200531"
            ]
          },
          "412200531": {
            "id": "412200531",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Before that, I ran the Nod-Krai trade route, hoping to make myself a small fortune.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200532"
            ]
          },
          "412200532": {
            "id": "412200532",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "But... I'm still here, so I'm sure you know how that turned out!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200533"
            ]
          },
          "412200533": {
            "id": "412200533",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What kind of business are you talking about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200534"
            ]
          },
          "412200534": {
            "id": "412200534",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Simple. You find me a few basic everyday items, cooking ingredients and the like, and then you trade them with me for a Box o' Marvels, full of all kinds of nice little treasures.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200535"
            ]
          },
          "412200535": {
            "id": "412200535",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Keep in mind that I've filled these Boxes o' Marvels with the fortune I made in my time as a seller of curios. There's no booby prizes to be found here, and I treat all my customers the same.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200536"
            ]
          },
          "412200536": {
            "id": "412200536",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Why box them up and turn it into a lucky draw, you ask?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200537"
            ]
          },
          "412200537": {
            "id": "412200537",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "What can I say, people like a gift box. It just makes everyone a little more inclined to get involved.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200538"
            ]
          },
          "412200538": {
            "id": "412200538",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How do you earn any money like this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200539"
            ]
          },
          "412200539": {
            "id": "412200539",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Hmm, fair point. Perhaps I should explore business opportunities in Natlan next time after all, eh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200540"
            ]
          },
          "412200540": {
            "id": "412200540",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Or maybe hire a few people for protection and make another trip to Nod-Krai, that might work too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200541"
            ]
          },
          "412200541": {
            "id": "412200541",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "To be honest, though, I'm getting pretty tired...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200542"
            ]
          },
          "412200542": {
            "id": "412200542",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Guess I'll take a break before making any more plans!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4122007",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "412200701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "412200701": {
            "id": "412200701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Hello, friend. It's been a long time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200702"
            ]
          },
          "412200702": {
            "id": "412200702",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Liben, I trust you've been well?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200703"
            ]
          },
          "412200703": {
            "id": "412200703",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Life is full of triumphs and setbacks. I've grown used to it, you know. A small illness is nothing to write home about, and minor losses are just part of the game.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200704"
            ]
          },
          "412200704": {
            "id": "412200704",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "So I suppose you could say I've been well enough, ha!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200705"
            ]
          },
          "412200705": {
            "id": "412200705",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "How about you, friend?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200707",
              "412200709"
            ]
          },
          "412200707": {
            "id": "412200707",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "That's marvelous to hear!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200710"
            ]
          },
          "412200710": {
            "id": "412200710",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "I am overjoyed today, because I have run into you once again, my friend!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200711"
            ]
          },
          "412200711": {
            "id": "412200711",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Anything interesting happening lately?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200712"
            ]
          },
          "412200712": {
            "id": "412200712",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Don't you think I ought to head to Natlan and seek out new business opportunities? Seize the day and strike while the iron's hot?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200713"
            ]
          },
          "412200713": {
            "id": "412200713",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Hahaha, I don't actually want to go to Natlan this time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200714"
            ]
          },
          "412200714": {
            "id": "412200714",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "A few days ago, I accidentally fell into a hole and spent the whole night staring at the stars.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200715"
            ]
          },
          "412200715": {
            "id": "412200715",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That definitely doesn't count as having been \"well\" lately...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200716"
            ]
          },
          "412200716": {
            "id": "412200716",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Anyway, I was rescued by a passing adventurer, and didn't even get hungry down there! All's well that ends well, am I right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200717"
            ]
          },
          "412200717": {
            "id": "412200717",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Looking up at the stars at night, I couldn't help but wonder... What lies beyond this world?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200718"
            ]
          },
          "412200718": {
            "id": "412200718",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Uh... Endless distance, and endless worlds.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200719"
            ]
          },
          "412200719": {
            "id": "412200719",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "You think so too, friend?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200720"
            ]
          },
          "412200720": {
            "id": "412200720",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "I was thinking how, what if every single star was actually a sun, and each of those suns had a planet orbiting it that we could visit?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200721"
            ]
          },
          "412200721": {
            "id": "412200721",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Or what if we could even visit every single star themselves? After all, they just give off light, maybe they aren't even that hot?"
          },
          "412200709": {
            "id": "412200709",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "...Really?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200727"
            ]
          },
          "412200727": {
            "id": "412200727",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Hey there, friend! It's been a while!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200728"
            ]
          },
          "412200728": {
            "id": "412200728",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It sure has, Liben!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412200729"
            ]
          },
          "412200729": {
            "id": "412200729",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Liben",
            "text": "Hehe, enthusiastic as ever, I see... I wonder, how changed a man am I?"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}